    "_plainLanguageExemptNote": "Per-dest, plain-language rules ONLY (buzzwords/sellMarkers): this manifest carries those word lists as data, so it ships exempt from the rules it defines. Every other rule still applies to it.",
    "plainLanguageExempt": [
