    "_unresolvedRequiresNote": "TD-095 (M28.D): resolve every require INSIDE the assembled tree — including the dynamic require(path.join(__dirname, ...)) form, which is the shape v1.0.0 shipped broken. A row whose dependency has no row REDs with the missing path named, before a tag is cut instead of by the public CI after one. Two resolution domains, both derived: a file executes where it is staged, EXCEPT a template, which resolves at its RENDERED path per the golden-bootstrap rows.json this manifest already ships. There is no allowlist — the domain rule is what removes the need for one.",
